WEBVTT

00:00:00.046 --> 00:00:01.370
Write a brief brain dump.

00:00:01.695 --> 00:00:05.387
Include the problem, people, desired experience,

00:00:05.828 --> 00:00:07.384
constraints, and uncertainty.

00:00:08.081 --> 00:00:11.064
Ask an agent for a structured readback and correct it.

00:00:11.505 --> 00:00:14.884
Your final journey must name an actor, trigger, actions,

00:00:14.907 --> 00:00:15.639
and result.

00:00:16.336 --> 00:00:18.983
Record what you agreed and what is still unknown.

00:00:19.366 --> 00:00:22.059
If the agent proposes technology before understanding the

00:00:22.106 --> 00:00:24.939
desired behavior, bring the conversation back to the

00:00:24.974 --> 00:00:25.484
readback.

00:00:25.926 --> 00:00:28.526
If the behavior is already agreed, proceed from that

00:00:28.596 --> 00:00:28.956
point.
